<p class="fig-cap">The staircase rises one step for every positive and moves right for every negative. The shaded area is the AUC.</p>

**AUC by rectangles** (each piece is width × height): 0.333 × 0.333 + 0.333 × 0.667 + 0.333 × 1 = **0.667**.

**Check by counting pairs.** AUC is also the chance that a random positive scores higher than a random negative: 6 of the 9 (positive, negative) pairs are ordered correctly, and 6/9 = 0.667.

